<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Invert</p>

<p>
<md>\frac1{
s(s+1)^2
}</md>
</p>

<p>using partial fractions.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Rewrite the function</p>

<p>
<md>f(t)
=
\begin{cases}
2,
&amp;
0\leq t&lt;4,
\\
7,
&amp;
t\geq4
\end{cases}</md>
</p>

<p>using a Heaviside step function.</p>
